The task packages under tasks/ are Mercor's APEX-Agents 1.1 benchmark,
redistributed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(CC BY 4.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode) with the
three image references repointed to a mirror at their original digests.
Attribution: Mercor, APEX-Agents 1.1, https://huggingface.co/datasets/mercor/apex-agents-v1.1.

The publisher's terms of use also apply: the benchmark is intended exclusively
for model evaluation; training, fine-tuning, or parameter fitting on it is
forbidden, as is crawling or scraping the dataset.

